    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49648" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ulmĭtrĭba</span></b> , ae,
			m.
		vox hibrida, from ulmus and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίβω</span>, tero, an elm-rubber, i. e. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>one that wears out
				elms</i>, <i>is often beaten with elm-rods</i>, a
			term of abuse, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Pers. 2, 4, 7</span></i>; cf.
		ulmus.</div>
